== Documented changes ==
=== Fixes ===
* Fixed bombing [[secret room|secret/special room]] walls.
* Fixed screensaver coming up during play on Linux.
* Fixed not being able to delete save slots on Steam Cloud.
* Fixed {{a|Judas}} [[achievement]] not unlocking with [[Black Judas]].

== Undocumented changes ==
=== Additions ===
* {{i|Mystery Sack}} now drops a random consumable every few rooms.
* {{i|The Book of Belial}} now has a use image.
* Added new seeds for Christmas.

=== Changes ===
* The Womb Room with four [[Gaping Maw]]s has been changed so that two of the Maws are "[[Broken Gaping Maw|broken]]", trying to suck Isaac in for 4 seconds and then stopping for 4 seconds.
* {{i|Samson's Chains}} is made easier to use.

