* Fixed hang on {{i|We Need To Go Deeper!}}.
* Fixed invisible laser damage.
* Fixed [[familiar]]s being overwritten by [[blue spider]]s/[[blue fly|flies]].
* Fixed {{s|Womb}} room with 4 [[Gaping Maw]]s in the center.
* Fixed Jar + Double Heart issues.
* Fixed {{i|Guppy's Collar}} hiding co-op babies.
* Fixed Full Health/[[rainbow poop]] for local co-op.

